        {
          "text": "This template uses the achemso class for submissions to American Chemical Society journals — JACS, Nano Letters, ACS Nano, Journal of Physical Chemistry and many others. The class handles ACS-specific formatting: structured abstracts (for some journals), author affiliations with superscript markers, and ACS citation style.",
